
- **dampen_spin**: If `true`, it will aggressively kill residual angular velocity to prevent unrealistic spinning upon release.

## Configuration Options

### FoxPhysicsDragProfile
The `FoxPhysicsDragProfile` class defines the physics characteristics of a grab action.

- **stiffness**: The "strength" of the pull. High values make it snappy, low values make it feel heavy.
- **damping**: The "control" of the pull. High values slow it down, low values make it bouncy.
- **keep_upright**: If `true`, forces the object to try and maintain an upright orientation.

